      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 402</b></color></size>

    <b>Clive meeting Mir Jafar after the Battle of Plassey</b>

    <size=74%>Battle fought 23 June 1757; painted c. 1760

    <i>Oil on canvas, by Francis Hayman</i>

    National Portrait Gallery, London</size>

    <size=70%><line-height=110%>

    At Plassey in Bengal, Robert Clive''s East India Company army defeated the Nawab Siraj-ud-Daulah, largely because the Nawab''s commander Mir Jafar had been bribed to hold back his troops. Mir Jafar became Nawab, and the Company became the real power in Bengal.</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 723364797c8904a93956dad57186ed9d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 3495093604678870679, guid: 723364797c8904a93956dad57186ed9d, type: 2}
