      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 404</b></color></size>\n<b>Rani Lakshmibai of Jhansi</b>\n<size=74%>1857\u20131858\n<i>Portrait</i>\nVarious collections</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nIn 1857 Indian soldiers of the Company army rose in revolt at Meerut, and the uprising spread across northern India. The Rani of Jhansi became one of its most famous leaders; she died fighting near Gwalior in June 1858. After the revolt, the British Crown took over the government of India.</size>"
